---
// Componente Footer basado en la plantilla SEOAI
---
<footer style="background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; padding: 80px 0 30px 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; position: relative; z-index: 2;">
        
        <!-- Caja Superior: Suscripción a Newsletter -->
        <div style="background: #1e293b; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 70px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 30px;">
            <div>
                <h3 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Subscribe Newsletter</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; max-width: 450px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    Subscribe to our newsletter to get the latest updates, news, and special offers directly in your inbox.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="display: flex; background: #0f172a; border-radius: 50px; padding: 6px; width: 100%; max-width: 420px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
                <input type="email" placeholder="Email Address" style="background: transparent; border: none; padding: 12px 20px; color: white; font-size: 14px; outline: none; width: 100%;" />
                <button style="background: #6366f1; border: none; width: 45px; height: 45px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);">
                    ✈
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Secciones de Enlaces del Footer -->
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 60px;">
            
            <!-- Columna 1: Logo y Redes Sociales -->
            <div>
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <div style="background: #6366f1; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white;">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; color: #ffffff;">Seoai<span style="color: #6366f1;">.</span></span>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px; color: #94a3b8;">
                    We are dedicated to delivering innovative digital solutions that help businesses grow, build strong brands,
                </p>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px;">
                    <a href="#" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">P</a>
                    <a href="#" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">X</a>
                    <a href="#" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">f</a>
                    <a href="#" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">in</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Columna 2: Quick Links -->
            <div>
                <h4 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;">Quick Links</h4>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
                    <li><a href="/" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s;">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/about" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s;">About Us</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/services" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s;">Services</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/blog" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s;">Blog</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/contact" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s;">Contact Us</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Columna 3: Our Services -->
            <div>
                <h4 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;">Our Services</h4>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
                    <li><a href="/services" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Business Profile Optimisation</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/services" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Advanced Keyword Research</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/services" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Voice Search Optimisation</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/services" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Search Engine Improvement</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/services" style="color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Performance Tracking</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Columna 4: Contact Information -->
            <div>
                <h4 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;">Contact Information</h4>
                <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 5px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">📞 Phone Number</p>
                    <a href="tel:123456789" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">123-456-789</a>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 5px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">✉ Email Address</p>
                    <a href="mailto:support@domainname.com" style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">support@domainname.com</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Línea divisoria y Copyright -->
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 30px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;">Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</footer>